    "created_at": "2022-08-10T15:49:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-08-10T15:50:47Z",
    "body": "In [7.1.1 Creating browsing contexts](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#creating-browsing-contexts), step 22 _may_ set the session history entry to 'launch' instead of 'default' if this is the first navigation after the browser process has been created and no other navigation has occurred previously due to the browser already being started.\r\n\r\nDoes that seem like the right place for it?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
